# IsoRim wild animals batch wild2 in the blob style (Arctic wolf, Warg, Red fox, Elk male + female). Generated by
# tools/make_wild2_concept.py (wild2 concept v2, 2026-11-09, not yet reviewed, not bound in Defs). Kd = the vanilla
# sprite's lit white.
# Warg takes its coat colour from the game (ModelDef tintFromGraphic, Api 49; vanilla tint (123,104,89)): Warg.png is
# white with the dark mane baked. Arctic wolf, red fox and elk: vanilla sprites are untinted, so their colours are baked.
# Arctic wolf: animal_wolf_arctic_blob.obj = the timber wolf's vertices, faces and UVs (only o / usemtl differ).
newmtl an_wolf_arctic_blob
